{"3549720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chimera Simulator", "steam_appid": 3549720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is Simulation with limited information about chimera's stat and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Chimera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game, you have 6 base animals to be chimera. You can make them to chimera by inserting gene. Chimera has several genes. Efficiently inserted Genes are very helpful to chimera's survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Genes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game, Genes are very important. They have stat coefficients and unique skill. Higher grades mean higher stat coefficients. And higher grade genes can be inserted more. In game, you can get 9 genes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Skill </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chimeras can use up to three additional skills. Some skills require conditions. You should carefully choose the 3 different genes that are inserted initially, considering those conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Test<br>Created chimeras require testing. A strong chimera is a surviving chimera. A defeated chimera is no longer usable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select animal and insert gene to selected animal. after this process, you can get your chimera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549720/extras/80e115aa5bec9d08834d85c53155b5ef.avif?t=1768717228\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549720/extras_big/80e115aa5bec9d08834d85c53155b5ef.avif?t=1768717228 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and test with Npc researchers. after test, you receive limited test info to create more power chimera. you should select between high status or skill efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549720/extras/33b92404596b443b7391a7c593648b69.avif?t=1768717228\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549720/extras_big/33b92404596b443b7391a7c593648b69.avif?t=1768717228 width=800 height=448 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is Simulation with limited information about chimera's stat and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Chimera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game, you have 6 base animals to be chimera. You can make them to chimera by inserting gene. Chimera has several genes. Efficiently inserted Genes are very helpful to chimera's survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Genes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game, Genes are very important. They have stat coefficients and unique skill. Higher grades mean higher stat coefficients. And higher grade genes can be inserted more. In game, you can get 9 genes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Skill </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chimeras can use up to three additional skills. Some skills require conditions. You should carefully choose the 3 different genes that are inserted initially, considering those conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Test<br>Created chimeras require testing. A strong chimera is a surviving chimera. A defeated chimera is no longer usable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select animal and insert gene to selected animal. after this process, you can get your chimera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea